    "## 1. 分布式训练全景 —— DataParallel vs DDP vs DeepSpeed ZeRO-1/2/3\n",
    "\n",
    "**不同 GPU 之间怎么并行？**\n",
    "\n",
    "**DataParallel (DP)**：\n",
    "- 同一台机器多卡（同机数据并行）\n",
    "- 每卡独立加载完整模型 → 显存压力大\n",
    "- PyTorch 原生支持，简单\n",
    "\n",
    "**DistributedDataParallel (DDP)**：\n",
    "- 同一台机器多卡（同机数据并行）\n",
    "- 一张卡持有完整模型副本（torch.nn.DataParallel 不再推荐）\n",
    "- 通过梯度同步，速度快\n",
    "\n",
    "**DeepSpeed ZeRO-1/2/3**：\n",
    "- 同一台机器多卡（同机）或 多机多卡\n",
    "- **ZeRO-1**：将优化器状态分片（每卡 1/N）\n",
    "- **ZeRO-2**：分片优化器 + 梯度\n",
    "- **ZeRO-3**：分片优化器 + 梯度 + 参数本身 → 每卡只存 1/N 参数\n",
    "- 支持大规模模型（70B+）\n",
    "\n",
    "**FSDP（Fully Sharded Data Parallel）**：\n",
    "- Facebook 的分片数据并行方案\n",
    "- 类似 ZeRO-3，但优化更多"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "s1-c1",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# OFFLINE 模式：模拟 DeepSpeed ZeRO 不同分片级别的显存占用\n",
    "\n",
    "def simulate_deepspeed_memory(model_size_gb, num_gpus, zero_stage):\n",
    "    \"\"\"模拟不同 ZeRO 分片级别的显存占用（OFFLINE）\"\"\"\n",
    "    if zero_stage == 0:\n",
    "        # 不分片，每卡完整模型\n",
    "        return model_size_gb\n",
    "    elif zero_stage == 1:\n",
    "        # 分片优化器状态（约 1/4 模型显存）\n",
    "        return model_size_gb * 0.5  # 略低于 0.5（仍需梯度等）\n",
    "    elif zero_stage == 2:\n",
    "        # 分片优化器 + 梯度\n",
    "        return model_size_gb * 0.35\n",
    "    elif zero_stage == 3:\n",
    "        # 分片优化器 + 梯度 + 参数\n",
    "        return model_size_gb * 0.2\n",
    "    else:\n",
    "        return model_size_gb\n",
    "\n",
    "# 对比 7B 模型在不同 ZeRO stage 下的显存\n",
    "model_7b = 7.0  # fp16 显存占用\n",
    "gpus = 4\n",
    "\n",
    "print('=== 7B 模型在 4 张 GPU 上不同 ZeRO stage 显存占用 ===')\n",
    "for stage in [0, 1, 2, 3]:\n",
    "    memory_per_gpu = simulate_deepspeed_memory(model_7b, gpus, stage)\n",
    "    print(f'  ZeRO-{stage}: {memory_per_gpu:.2f} GB/GPU ({memory_per_gpu/model_7b*100:.0f}% of base)')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "s2-md",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. YaRN 扩展上下文原理 —— NTK Scaling + RoPE\n",
    "\n",
    **长上下文扩展方法**：\n",
    "\n",
    "**NTK Scaling（NAIS scaling）**：\n",
    "- 原理：在推理时增大 RoPE 的 base，模拟更大上下文的建模能力\n",
    "- 公式：`base = base * (context_len / 4096) ** (0.25)` （经验公式）\n",
    "- 效果：短上下文模型可以跑长上下文，但性能略有下降\n",
    "\n",
    "**LongRoPE**：\n",
    "- 更细粒度的扩展（不同层用不同 base）\n",
    "- 效果优于 NTK scaling\n",
    "\n",
    "RoPE（Rotary Position Embedding）基础：\n",
    "- 用旋转矩阵编码位置信息\n",
    "- 注意力计算时考虑位置 → 支持长上下文推理\n",
    "\n",
    "**YaRN（Yet another RoPE extensioN）**：\n",
    "- 综合多种扩展方法（NTK / LongRoPE）\n",
    "- 提供统一的 API\n",
    "- 支持 Llama-2、Llama-3 等模型"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "s2-c1",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# OFFLINE 模式：模拟 NTK scaling 公式\n",
    "\n",
    "def simulate_ntk_scaling(original_base, original_context=4096, target_context=8192):\n",
    "    \"\"\"模拟 NTK scaling 公式\"\"\"\n",
    "    # NTK scaling 公式（近似）\n",
    "    new_base = original_base * (target_context / original_context) ** 0.25\n",
    "    return new_base\n",
    "\n",
    "# 对比不同扩展倍数下的 base 变化\n",
    "bases = [10000, 5000, 16000]  # Llama-2/3 常见 base\n",
    "for original_base in bases:\n",
    "    new_base_8k = simulate_ntk_scaling(original_base, original_context=4096, target_context=8192)\n",
    "    new_base_16k = simulate_ntk_scaling(original_base, original_context=4096, target_context=16384)\n",
    "    new_base_32k = simulate_ntk_scaling(original_base, original_context=4096, target_context=32768)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    print(f'Original base={original_base}:')\n",
    "    print(f'  8K context → base={new_base_8k:.0f} ({new_base_8k/original_base*100:.0f}% increase)')\n",
    "    print(f'  16K context → base={new_base_16k:.0f} ({new_base_16k/original_base*100:.0f}% increase)')\n",
    "    print(f'  32K context → base={new_base_32k:.0f} ({new_base_32k/original_base*100:.0f}% increase)')\n",
    "    print()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "s2-c2",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# OFFLINE 模式：模拟 LongRoPE 的混合扩展（不同层用不同 base）\n",
    "\n",
    "def simulate_longrope(original_base, context=32768, n_layers=32):\n",
    "    \"\"\"模拟 LongRoPE 混合扩展（简化版）\"\"\"\n",
    "    # 不同层用不同的 base，越深层 base 越大\n",
    "    bases = []\n",
    "    for layer in range(n_layers):\n",
    "        # 线性插值：第 0 层用原始 base，第 n_layers-1 层用放大后的 base\n",
    "        ratio = layer / (n_layers - 1)\n",
    "        new_base = original_base * (1 + ratio * 0.5)  # 最多 50% 放大\n",
    "        bases.append(new_base)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    return bases\n",
    "\n",
    "# 对比 NTK scaling 和 LongRoPE 的 base 分布\n",
    "base_ntk = simulate_ntk_scaling(10000, original_context=4096, target_context=32768)\n",
    "bases_longrope = simulate_longrope(10000, context=32768, n_layers=32)\n",
    "\n",
    "print('=== NTK scaling vs LongRoPE base 分布对比（32K context）===')\n",
    "print(f'NTK scaling: base={base_ntk:.0f} (所有层相同)')\n",
    "print(f'LongRoPE: 层 0 = {bases_longrope[0]:.0f}, 层 16 = {bases_longrope[16]:.0f}, 层 31 = {bases_longrope[31]:.0f}')\n",
    "print('\\n**关键差异**：')\n",
    "print('  - NTK scaling: 所有层用相同的放大的 base')\n",
    "print('  - LongRoPE: 不同层用不同的 base，越深层 base 越大（更细粒度）')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "s3-md",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. mergekit 使用 —— 多个 LoRA 合并到一个 base\n",
    "\n",
    **场景**：\n",
    "- 有多个 LoRA（不同任务 / 不同领域）\n",
    "- 想把它们合并到一个 base 模型\n",
    "- 或者合并多个 LoRA → 生成一个「超级 LoRA」\n",
    "\n",
    **mergekit 关键参数**：\n",
    "- `slices`: 指定哪些层应用哪个 LoRA\n",
    "- `merge_method`: merge 方法（linear / sincos / taylor / passthrough 等）\n",
    "\n",
    **使用示例**：\n",
    "```yaml\n",
    "slices:\n",
    "  - sources:\n",
    "      - model: base\n",
    "      - layer_range: [0, 32]\n",
    "        layers: [0, 1]  # 前两层用 LoRA A\n",
    "      - layer_range: [32, 64]\n",
    "        layers: [2, 3]  # 中间两层用 LoRA B\n",
    "  # ...\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "s3-c1",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# OFFLINE 模式：模拟 mergekit 配置结构\n",
    "\n",
    "mergekit_config = {\n",
    "    \"slices\": [\n",
    "        {\n",
    "            \"sources\": [\n",
    "                {\"model\": \"base\"},\n",
    "                {\"layer_range\": [0, 32], \"layers\": [0, 1]},\n",
    "                {\"layer_range\": [32, 64], \"layers\": [2, 3]}\n",
    "            ]\n",
    "        },\n",
    "        {\n",
    "            \"sources\": [\n",
    "                {\"model\": \"base\"},\n",
    "                {\"layer_range\": [0, 32], \"layers\": [4, 5]},\n",
    "                {\"layer_range\": [32, 64], \"layers\": [6, 7]}\n",
    "            ]\n",
    "        }\n",
    "    ],\n",
    "    \"merge_method\": \"linear\",\n",
    "    \"base_model\": \"Qwen/Qwen2.5-7B\"\n",
    "}\n",
    "\n",
    "print('=== mergekit 配置示例 ===')\n",
    "import json\n",
    "print(json.dumps(mergekit_config, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False))"
   ]
  },
