   "source": [
    "## 4. 源码精读 —— transformers/models/llama/modeling_llama.py 的 LoRA hook 点\n",
    "\n",
    **精读目标**：理解 LoRA 是怎么「hook」进模型的。\n",
    "\n",
    **关键代码路径**（PyTorch 原生 LoRA）：\n",
    "1. `PeftModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained()` → 加载基座模型\n",
    "2. `PeftModel.add_adapter()` → 初始化 LoRA 适配器\n",
    "3. `LoraLinear` 类 → 继承 `nn.Linear`，在 `forward()` 里注入 LoRA\n",
    "\n",
    **核心原理**：\n",
    "```python\n",
    "class LoraLinear(nn.Linear):\n",
    "    def forward(self, x):\n",
    "        # 原始计算\n",
    "        result = super().forward(x)\n",
    "        # LoRA 计算：B @ (A @ x)\n",
    "        lora_result = self.lora_B @ (self.lora_A @ x)\n",
    "        return result + self.scaling * lora_result\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "s4-c1",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# OFFLINE 模式：模拟 LoRALinear 的 hook 原理\n",
    "\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "\n",
    "class LoraLinear:\n",
    "    \"\"\"模拟 LoRA Linear 层的 hook 逻辑\"\"\"\n",
    "    def __init__(self, in_features, out_features, rank=16, alpha=32):\n",
    "        super().__init__(in_features, out_features)\n",
    "        self.rank = rank\n",
    "        self.alpha = alpha\n",
    "        # LoRA 参数：A（输入投影）和 B（输出投影）\n",
    "        self.lora_A = np.random.randn(rank, in_features) * 0.01\n",
    "        self.lora_B = np.random.randn(out_features, rank) * 0.01\n",
    "        # 缩放因子\n",
    "        self.scaling = self.alpha / self.rank\n",
    "    \n",
    "    def forward(self, x):\n",
    "        # 1. 原始计算（模拟）\n",
    "        result = np.dot(x, self.weight.T)\n",
    "        \n",
    "        # 2. LoRA 计算：A @ x → B @ (A @ x)\n",
    "        lora_result = np.dot(self.lora_B, np.dot(self.lora_A, x))\n",
    "        \n",
    "        # 3. 合并：原始结果 + LoRA 增量\n",
    "        output = result + self.scaling * lora_result\n",
    "        \n",
    "        return output\n",
    "\n",
    "# 测试\n",
    "lora_layer = LoraLinear(in_features=4096, out_features=4096, rank=16, alpha=32)\n",
    "input_x = np.random.randn(10, 4096)  # batch=10, hidden=4096\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'输入形状: {input_x.shape}')\n",
    "output = lora_layer.forward(input_x)\n",
    "print(f'输出形状: {output.shape}')\n",
    "print(f'参数增量: {np.prod(lora_layer.lora_A.shape) + np.prod(lora_layer.lora_B.shape)} (rank={lora_layer.rank})')"
   ]
  },
